s cited; details given of signs of a global recession. [UBS Art CASHIN&#134;- comments on the historic nature of the crisis.] [Professional trader Dennis GARTMAN&#134;- explains a Wall Street rule for selling.] OPEC\u2019s decision to cut oil production noted. ", "segment_duration": 280, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921980, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "yxBOvuW6BY", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921979, "segment_id": "IvC5cJqevR", "segment_broadcast_id": "yxBOvuW6BY", "segment_title": "Decision 2008 / Obama vs. McCain", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) White House photo shown of President Bush casting his early vote for Senator John McCain; Michelle Obama shown campaigning in Columbus, Ohio, while Senator Barack Obama is visiting his sick grandmother in Hawaii; Senator John McCain shown campaigning in Denver, where he criticized Obama\u2019s tax plan, and Governor Sarah Palin\u2019s deposition in the investigation of the firing of a safety official in Alaska noted; scenes shown of Palin in Springfield, Missouri.  ", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63330.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921981, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "yxBOvuW6BY", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "N